{"id":"vd-a1-a-picnic-in-the-rain","level":"a1","n":3,"title":{"en":"What's the Weather Like?","vi":"Trời hôm nay thế nào?"},"summary":"Sáng thứ Bảy mưa to đúng hôm cả nhà định đi dã ngoại — Ella hỏi mẹ về thời tiết, còn mẹ có một kế hoạch khác.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-a-picnic-in-the-rain","level":"a1","title":{"en":"A Picnic in the Rain","vi":"Buổi dã ngoại dưới mưa"}},"scene":{"background":"home-day","weather":"rain","props":[{"id":"sandwich","x":860}]},"cast":{"ella":{"name":{"en":"Ella","vi":"Ella"},"look":"girl","x":400,"style":{"hair":"pigtails","hairColor":"#B5652E","top":"#F2C14E","topShade":"#D9A933"}},"mom":{"name":{"en":"Mom","vi":"Mẹ"},"look":"mom","x":1150,"style":{"hairColor":"#5A3B2E","top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765","collar":"#EAF6EE"}},"toby":{"name":{"en":"Toby","vi":"Toby"},"look":"boy","x":640,"style":{"hairColor":"#B5652E","top":"#E07B5F","topShade":"#C8654B","collar":"#C8654B"},"from":6}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ella","en":"Mom! What's the weather like?","vi":"Mẹ ơi! Trời hôm nay thế nào ạ?","ipa":["mɑm","wʌts","ðə","ˈwɛðɚ","laɪk"],"start":0.554,"end":3.294,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,2.064],[2,2.448],[3,2.604],[4,3.002]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"Look out of the window. It's raining.","vi":"Con nhìn ra cửa sổ đi. Trời đang mưa.","ipa":["lʊk","aʊt","ʌv","ðə","ˈwɪndoʊ","ɪts","ˈɹeɪnɪŋ"],"start":4.084,"end":6.534,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,4.084],[1,4.271],[2,4.427],[3,4.512],[4,4.626],[5,5.599],[6,5.911]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"But the phone said, \"It's going to be sunny!\"","vi":"Nhưng điện thoại bảo: \"Trời sẽ nắng mà!\"","ipa":["bʌt","ðə","foʊn","sɛd","ɪts","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","bi","ˈsʌni"],"start":7.324,"end":10.304,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,7.324],[1,7.468],[2,7.61],[3,8.05],[4,8.846],[5,9.059],[6,9.428],[7,9.556],[8,9.755]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"I know. The phone was wrong.","vi":"Mẹ biết. Điện thoại nói sai rồi.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","ðə","foʊn","wɑz","ɹɔŋ"],"start":11.094,"end":13.394,"gesture":"shrug","timing":[[0,11.094],[1,11.161],[2,12.02],[3,12.233],[4,12.645],[5,12.858]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"So no picnic by the river?","vi":"Vậy là không đi dã ngoại ngoài sông nữa ạ?","ipa":["soʊ","noʊ","ˈpɪkˌnɪk","baɪ","ðə","ˈɹɪvɚ"],"start":14.184,"end":16.174,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,14.184],[1,14.399],[2,14.697],[3,15.322],[4,15.521],[5,15.678]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"Not today. It's cold and wet outside.","vi":"Hôm nay thì không. Ngoài trời vừa lạnh vừa ướt.","ipa":["nɑt","təˈdeɪ","ɪts","koʊld","ənd","wɛt","ˈaʊtˈsaɪd"],"start":16.964,"end":20.044,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,16.964],[1,17.189],[2,18.105],[3,18.389],[4,18.986],[5,19.199],[6,19.412]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"Mom! Is it raining? No picnic?","vi":"Mẹ ơi! Trời mưa ạ? Không đi dã ngoại ạ?","ipa":["mɑm","ɪz","ɪt","ˈɹeɪnɪŋ","noʊ","ˈpɪkˌnɪk"],"start":20.834,"end":24.884,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,20.834],[1,22.246],[2,22.459],[3,22.645],[4,24.095],[5,24.374]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"Wait, Toby. I have an idea.","vi":"Đợi đã, Toby. Mẹ có ý này.","ipa":["weɪt","ˈtoʊbi","aɪ","hæv","æn","aɪˈdiə"],"start":25.674,"end":28.074,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,25.674],[1,25.974],[2,26.919],[3,27.231],[4,27.402],[5,27.515]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"Let's have a picnic here, on the floor!","vi":"Mình dã ngoại ngay ở đây, trên sàn nhà luôn!","ipa":["lɛts","hæv","ə","ˈpɪkˌnɪk","hiɹ","ɑn","ðə","flɔɹ"],"start":28.614,"end":30.624,"expression":"happy","gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,28.614],[1,28.772],[2,28.957],[3,29.056],[4,29.454],[5,29.823],[6,29.951],[7,30.065]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"Here? In the living room?","vi":"Ở đây ạ? Trong phòng khách á?","ipa":["hiɹ","ɪn","ðə","ˈlɪvɪŋ","ɹum"],"start":31.414,"end":33.894,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,31.414],[1,32.748],[2,32.947],[3,33.089],[4,33.529]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"Yes! A big green blanket is our grass.","vi":"Ừ! Tấm chăn xanh to kia sẽ là bãi cỏ.","ipa":["jɛs","ə","bɪɡ","ɡɹin","ˈblæŋkət","ɪz","ˈaʊɚ","ɡɹæs"],"start":34.684,"end":38.114,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,34.684],[1,35.64],[2,35.896],[3,36.237],[4,36.564],[5,37.217],[6,37.359],[7,37.558]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"And the sandwiches?","vi":"Còn bánh mì kẹp thì sao ạ?","ipa":["ənd","ðə","ˈsændwɪtʃɪz"],"start":38.904,"end":40.064,"expression":"confused","prop":"sandwich","timing":[[0,38.904],[1,39.037],[2,39.156]]},{"speaker":"mom","en":"They're ready! Come and eat.","vi":"Làm xong rồi! Lại đây ăn nào.","ipa":["ðɛɹ","ˈɹɛdi","kʌm","ənd","it"],"start":40.854,"end":42.774,"expression":"happy","gesture":"point","prop":"sandwich","timing":[[0,40.854],[1,41.002],[2,41.847],[3,42.216],[4,42.387]]},{"speaker":"ella","en":"A picnic in the rain. I love it!","vi":"Dã ngoại trong mưa. Con thích quá!","ipa":["ə","ˈpɪkˌnɪk","ɪn","ðə","ɹeɪn","aɪ","lʌv","ɪt"],"start":43.564,"end":46.894,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"toby":"happy"},"timing":[[0,43.564],[1,43.633],[2,44.258],[3,44.443],[4,44.585],[5,46.069],[6,46.282],[7,46.708]]}],"words":[{"id":"weather","en":"weather","ipa":"ˈwɛðɚ","vi":"thời tiết","level":0},{"id":"rain","en":"rain","ipa":"ɹeɪn","vi":"mưa; cơn mưa","level":0},{"id":"picnic","en":"picnic","ipa":"ˈpɪkˌnɪk","vi":"buổi dã ngoại; đi picnic","level":0},{"id":"idea","en":"idea","ipa":"aɪˈdiə","vi":"ý tưởng; ý kiến; ý niệm","level":0},{"id":"floor","en":"floor","ipa":"flɔɹ","vi":"sàn nhà; tầng","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi và nói về thời tiết","pattern":"What's the weather like? · It's raining. · It's sunny / cold / windy.","explain":"Hỏi thời tiết dùng \"What's the weather like?\". Đáp bằng \"It's + tính từ\" (sunny, cloudy, cold) hoặc \"It's raining / snowing\" khi trời đang mưa, đang có tuyết.","keys":["what's the weather like","it's raining","it's sunny","it's going to be"],"lines":[0,1,2]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-a-picnic-in-the-rain.mp3","v":"dcaf53f4c2","duration":48,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}